    The number of most relevant document chunks that should be returned.
 
+5. **Reranker** (optional)
+
+   A reranker takes a wider pool of candidate chunks (by default the 20 closest), reads the question together with each chunk, and keeps the best Top-K.
+   It usually returns better chunks than the embedding search alone, especially when many passages are relevant or when chunks share words with the question without answering it.
+   It adds little when each question was written from one specific passage, because the embedding search then already finds that passage.
+
